<section class="page-hero page-hero--photo page-hero--about">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
    <h1>A London &amp; Essex cleaning company, not a franchise.</h1>
    <p>Our own staff. Ten years of jobs for homes, landlords, agents and workplaces.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container grid grid-2 align-center">
    <div class="about-media">
      <img src="/images/about-cleaner.jpg?v=<%= assetVersion %>" alt="A professional cleaner from SN Cleaning Services" />
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">The company</span>
      <h2>Built on turning up and doing the list</h2>
      <p>
        For over 10 years, <%= site.name %> has cleaned homes, tenancy handovers and workplaces
        across London and Essex. We never use subcontractors: every job is done by our own trained,
        DBS-checked and insured staff.
      </p>
      <p>
        We work with homeowners, landlords, letting agents, schools, nurseries and businesses —
        from a weekly tidy to a full end-of-tenancy deep clean. If we miss something, tell us
        within 24 hours and we come back and re-clean it, free.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section alt-bg">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="eyebrow">Our Values</span>
      <h2>What guides how we work</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <div class="card value-card">
        <h3>Reliability</h3>
        <p>We show up on time, every time, and communicate clearly if anything ever changes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card value-card">
        <h3>Attention to Detail</h3>
        <p>We don't cut corners — every clean follows a checklist so nothing gets missed.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card value-card">
        <h3>Trust</h3>
        <p>Background-checked, insured cleaners you can feel comfortable letting into your home or office.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="eyebrow">The basics</span>
      <h2>What we stand on</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-card-grid stat-card-grid--wide">
      <div class="stat-card"><strong>10+</strong><span>Years in the area</span></div>
      <div class="stat-card"><strong>London &amp; Essex</strong><span>Where we work</span></div>
      <div class="stat-card"><strong>Own staff</strong><span>No gig workers</span></div>
      <div class="stat-card"><strong>Re-clean</strong><span>If we miss a bit</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section cta-band">
  <div class="container cta-band-inner">
    <div>
      <h2>Need a team you can leave a key with?</h2>
      <p>Tell us about the property. We'll quote you — usually the same weekday.</p>
    </div>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Request a quote</a>
  </div>
</section>
